# Software Requirements Specification (SRS)
## Cine Verse — Animated Movie Search Platform

**Version:** 1.0
**Date:** August 2026

---

## 1. Introduction

### 1.1 Purpose
This document specifies the software requirements for Cine Verse, an animated movie search platform. It defines the functional and non-functional requirements, system interfaces, and constraints necessary for the design, development, and evaluation of the application.

### 1.2 Intended Audience
This SRS is intended for the project developer, project evaluators/instructors, and any collaborators involved in the design or review of the system.

### 1.3 Project Scope
Cine Verse allows users to search for movies by title and view detailed information — poster, plot, cast, genre, release year, and ratings — retrieved live from the TMDB API. The application emphasizes a smooth, animated user experience across all interface states (searching, loading, displaying results, and error handling). The system is a client-facing web application and does not include user accounts, persistent storage, or backend infrastructure in its initial scope.

